  "description": "Email Studio content store: templates authored as content, their versions with test sends and second-person approval, one-click rollback, and the append-only check and AI generation records, as EF Core entities with their mappings and table scripts. Answers the template catalog and the renderer with the Active stored templates and the live version. The product owns the DbContext, the tables and the hosts, and registers the email kinds through Webority.Email.Razor.",
